  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Melanesian Spearhead Group (MSG) Secretariat Strengthening Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australia is looking to strengthen its relationship with the MSG Secretariat based in Port Vila. The MSG Secretariat Strengthening Project will focus on establishing a Project Coordination Unit to boost the Secretariat&apos;s capacity to mobilise resources and effectively manage donor funding.
This investment will include scope for the MSG Secretariat to access specialist technical assistance to address gaps in capacity, including for monitoring, evaluation and learning, gender analysis, audit, and strategic planning .</narrative>
  </description>
